4. She has strong bladder control and can go long periods without using the bathroom. (Verbatim: "I can hold, I can hold, easy, easy, easy.")
5. She finds American Coca-Cola to taste unpleasant due to high fructose corn syrup. (Verbatim: "It tastes so weird! It tastes so, so, so, so, so, so, so weird!")
6. She enjoys small, sour cream-flavored pretzels served on flights to or from America. (Verbatim: "I really like the little pretzels. Yeah. Yeah. Also, Southside Slider.")
